{"suttaId":"sn27.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[1192,1192],"vripara":"322"},"segments":{"sn27.1:0.3":"Cakkhusuttaṃ","sn27.1:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn27.1:1.2":"“Yo, bhikkhave, cakkhusmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.3":"Yo sotasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.4":"Yo ghānasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.5":"Yo jivhāya chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.6":"Yo kāyasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.7":"Yo manasmiṃ chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.1:1.8":"Yato kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno imesu chasu ṭhānesu cetaso upakkileso pahīno hoti, nekkhammaninnañcassa cittaṃ hoti.","sn27.1:1.9":"Nekkhammaparibhāvitaṃ cittaṃ kammaniyaṃ khāyati, abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū”ti.","sn27.1:1.10":"Paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":455,"to":455,"paras":[{"para":455,"vripara":"322-331","refs":["sn27.1:1"],"lines":["322-331. Kilesasaṃyutte <b>cittasseso upakkileso</b>ti kataracittassa?","Catubhūmakacittassa.","Tebhūmakacittassa tāva hotu, lokuttarassa kathaṃ upakkileso hotīti?","Uppattinivāraṇato.","So hi tassa uppajjituṃ appadānena upakkilesoti veditabbo.","<b>Nekkhammaninnan</b>ti navalokuttaradhammaninnaṃ.","<b>Cittan</b>ti samathavipassanācittaṃ.","<b>Abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū</b>ti paccavekkhaṇañāṇena abhijānitvā sacchikātabbesu chaḷabhiññādhammesu, ekaṃ dhammaṃ vā gaṇhantena nekkhammanti gahetabbaṃ.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn27.1:1.2","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.3","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.4","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.5","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.6","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.7","cittasseso upakkileso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.8","nekkhammaninnaṃ",0,5],["sn27.1:1.2","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.3","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.4","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.5","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.6","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.7","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.8","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.9","cittaṃ",0,6],["sn27.1:1.9","abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū",0,7]]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":479,"to":479,"paras":[{"para":479,"vripara":"322-331","refs":["sn27.1:1"],"lines":["322-331. <b>Eso</b>ti cakkhusmiṃ chandarāgo.","Upecca kilesetīti <b>upakkileso.</b>","<b>Cittassā</b>ti sāmaññavacanaṃ anicchanto codako <b>“kataracittassā”</b>ti āha.","Itaro kāmaṃ upatāpanamalīnabhāvakaraṇavasena upakkileso lokuttarassa natthi, vibādhanaṭṭho pana attheva uppattinivāraṇatoti adhippāyenāha <b>“catubhūmakacittassā”</b>ti.","Codako <b>“tebhūmakā”</b>tiādinā attano adhippāyaṃ vivarati, itaro <b>“uppattinivāraṇato”</b>tiādinā.","Ariyaphalapaṭippassaddhipahānavasena pavattiyā sabbasaṃkilesato nikkhantattā nekkhammaṃ, magganibbānānaṃ pana nekkhammabhāvo ukkaṃsato gahito evāti āha <b>“nekkhammaninnanti navalokuttaradhammaninnan”</b>ti.","<b>Abhijānitvā</b>ti abhimukhabhāvena jānitvā.","<b>Sacchikātabbesū</b>ti paccakkhakātabbesu.","<b>Chaḷabhiññādhammesū</b>ti ariyamaggasampayuttadhammesu."],"lineRefs":[["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"],["sn27.1:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn27.1:1.2","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.3","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.4","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.5","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.6","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.7","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.8","eso",0,0],["sn27.1:1.2","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.3","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.4","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.5","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.6","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.7","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.8","upakkileso",0,1],["sn27.1:1.2","cittassā",0,2],["sn27.1:1.3","cittassā",0,2],["sn27.1:1.4","cittassā",0,2],["sn27.1:1.5","cittassā",0,2],["sn27.1:1.6","cittassā",0,2],["sn27.1:1.7","ci